{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would constitute self-contained accommodation within the curtilage of existing housing and would not accord with other Development Plan policies. It would therefore be unacceptable in principle and would fail to comply with Local Plan policy SC1.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would be unacceptable in terms of its design quality and massing and would be contrary to Local Plan policies CC1 and CC2.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal would result in a loss of outlook and privacy as well as a harmful sense of enclosure to neighbouring occupiers, contrary to Local Plan policies CC1 and CC2.",
    "Reason : 4 - Without evidence to the contrary the proposal would fail to provide an acceptable level of private outdoor amenity space for future occupiers contrary to London Plan D6 and Local Plan policy SC5.",
    "Reason : 5 - The proposal would represent an overprovision of parking and, without evidence to the contrary, the proposal would result in harm to the safety and efficiency of the local transport network contrary to London Plan policies T4 and T6.1 and Local Plan policy EC2."
  ],
